dut              Script:  initial,ospf,vrf,tunnel.wireguard
r2               Script:  initial,ospf,tunnel.wireguard


Test dual-stack WireGuard tunnels in a transport VRF. The tested device
has a WireGuard tunnel in the transport VRF carrying both IPv4 and IPv6 and
runs (global) OSPFv2 and OSPFv3 over it. The probe should receive the routes
advertised from the remote device (DUT) and be able to ping its loopback
over both address families.

